# Magnetic boots: in zero g with the jetpack off the boots hold the astronaut to a station's floor and the astronaut walks on
# them; the plugin, which steadies the view against the grid's bumps, reports its steps on the boots every ten seconds.
# World: Green Station (survival; an asteroid base, no gravity; the astronaut starts on foot, on the base's floor).
# The walk goes forward a second and a half, then back.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Green Station
# zero g: the station's artificial gravity off
switch GravityGenerator off
switch GravityGeneratorSphere off
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# the jetpack is off, so the boots hold the astronaut to the floor: the plugin's steps on them are on the grid
read character
expect jetpack == false
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect log /Magnetic boots .* [1-9][0-9]* steps on boots [(][1-9][0-9]* on a grid/ within 15

# walking on the boots
read character
mark
stick left 0 1
wait 1.5
stick left 0 0
read character
expect position moved > 0.5
expect jetpack == false
stick left 0 -1
wait 1.5
stick left 0 0
